                            "phase":  "review",
                            "d":  "�o"",
                            "date":  "2026-08-24",
                            "note":  "Proposed reverting the `Transfering` move (panel_20260824_055023, the capped ask-again). REFUTED BY A MEASUREMENT ALREADY TAKEN: Proposed reverting the `Transfering` move. REFUTED BY A MEASUREMENT ALREADY TAKEN: probe_pre51.raw IS that build, and `nodata notx` reads 1 against a wanted 0 there, sole red. Recorded as refuted rather than filed -- filing it would have put a phantom escape on the queue."
                        },
                        {
