                            "note":  "PANEL panel_20260824_055023. This Agent seat answered in that panel; its findings are recorded in this row\u0027s other entries and in OUTSTANDING_BUGS. Entry added so the stage reflects the nine seats that actually answered rather than the seven whose files sit in the panel dir -- the two Agent seats leave no file there, which is exactly why they were the ones missed."
