   The collision is reached through host configuration during construction, not by a running guest. **The missing-clock host termination mentioned in its filing was already removed by #459.**  
   Falsifier: device construction has explicit ownership compatible with the CPU topology and routes interrupts to that owner. Current registration and lookup do neither.

